; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\session.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: IconLock, IconRestart, IconShutdown; empty = no icon).
;  Lock, restart, shut down. Variant for *Popup; menus\session-startmenu.rc has the same entries for *PopupStartMenu.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Personal additions go in
;  personal.rc (star lines there add items).
; ==============================================================================
*Popup .icon="$IconLock$" "Bloquear" !Execute [rundll32.exe user32.dll,LockWorkStation]
*Popup .icon="$IconRestart$" "Reiniciar" !Execute [shutdown.exe /r /t 0]
*Popup .icon="$IconShutdown$" "Apagar" !Execute [shutdown.exe /s /t 0]
